Build: complement (CC0-1.0)
---------------------------
Fast list from public-domain sources and our own curation, meant to run alongside HaGeZi TIF.

* ProjectBlacklist curated data (CC0-1.0), https://github.com/JonathonPunc/ProjectBlacklist

* phishunt.io (CC0-1.0), https://phishunt.io/
  Condition: Describe entries as suspected, never as confirmed phishing (phishunt ToS sections 3 and 4).
